  "Tutorial Start",
  "You, the player, command",
  "your own forces, starting with",
  "the Earth Federation, and take",
  "part in the story.",
  "First, before entering battle,",
  "you can make preparations.",
  "That is what",
  "this Battle Prep menu is for.",
  "For most of the items,",
  "trying them out yourself",
  "will make things clearer,",
  "so here",
  "I'll just briefly explain",
  "a few of them.",
  "[Custom Team]",
  "For each stage,",
  "and for one team only,",
  "you can freely",
  "organize a team",
  "and have it join",
  "the battle.",
  "Unfortunately, however,",
  "it cannot be selected",
  "in this stage just yet.",
  "A little further",
  "along in the story,",
  "it will become available.",
