  "if such a character",
  "or unit",
  "is destroyed in the fight,",
  "from the next stage on",
  "it can no longer be used,",
  "so be careful.",
  "Also, like the previous item,",
  "[Save]",
  "Selecting this lets you",
  "record the current",
