  "Then, by selecting",
  "[Start Battle] here,",
  "you can begin",
  "the battle.",
  "After that, with your own hands,",
  "try it out for real",
  "and see how it all works.",
  "Tutorial End",
  "To you, who have already",
  "fought through one fierce battle,",
  "some of this may seem",
  "like old news, but",
  "here, as a supplement,",
  "I'd like to go over a few items",
  "briefly.",
  "First, the areas",
  "of the battle map.",
  "Let me explain.",
  "The battle map",
  "has lines drawn on it,",
  "dividing it into",
  "multiple areas.",
  "Team movement and the like",
  "is done",
  "area by area.",
  "As you can see at a glance,",
  "each area",
  "differs greatly in shape,",
  "and the number of adjacent areas,",
  "depending on shape and layout,",
  "can be just one, or five--",
  "it varies widely.",
  "More adjacent areas",
  "widen your choice of moves,",
  "but on the other hand,",
  "you can be attacked from many",
  "directions: there are merits",
  "and drawbacks alike.",
  "And the reverse is also true.",
  "Next,",
  "the Team menu.",
  "You may know some of this,",
  "but as a review, once more",
  "I'll explain it briefly.",
  "On the lower screen,",
  "selecting a team symbol",
  "will open",
  "the Team menu.",
  "[Move]",
  "The team's move",
  "is ordered with this command.",
  "For the destination,",
  "you can pick",
  "any glowing area.",
  "Note that movement cost",
  "varies by terrain.",
  "On the ground,",
  "mountains, deserts and so on",
  "fall into this category, and",
  "in space as well,",
  "darker-colored areas",
  "are debris (space junk) zones",
  "that cost more movement.",
  "A team cannot always move",
  "as many areas as its",
  "movement value allows,",
  "so please keep that in mind.",
  "[Edit]",
  "When several teams",
  "are in the same area,",
  "each team's lineup",
  "can be freely changed",
  "with this command, but",
  "in this battle, your forces",
  "have only one team,",
  "so selecting it does nothing.",
  "As for this command,",
  "I'll explain it",
  "in due course.",
  "[Info]",
  "A command for checking",
  "that team's lineup.",
  "Also, while a team is selected,",
  "the upper screen switches,",
  "and that team's",
  "parameters are shown.",
  "When you fight, or",
  "compare it with other teams,",
  "it never hurts",
  "to watch these parameters.",
  "With that, I'll conclude",
  "my explanation of",
  "map areas and",
  "the Team menu.",
  "Now, next,",
  "I'd like to go on",
  "to explain combat.",
  "To start a battle,",
  "as already explained,",
  "move your team into",
  "an area where the enemy is.",
  "Or the other way around.",
  "Here, as a test,",
  "let's move",
  "the Gundam to where",
  "the Zaku is.",
  "After you move it,",
  "a confirmation appears;",
  "press the A Button",
  "to confirm.",
  "Once you've confirmed",
  "the destination,",
  "the screen switches to",
  "the battle start screen.",
  "After the screen switched,",
  "you should have seen",
  "various effects appear",
  "on screen one after another.",
  "Previously I skipped over",
  "explaining this part,",
  "but here I'd like",
  "to explain it properly.",
  "Skills held by units,",
  "skills held by characters,",
  "and terrain effects:",
  "from all these effects,",
  "the final",
  "strength values of both sides,",
  "and the battle forecast",
  "calculated from them,",
  "are displayed.",
  "When a unit's skill",
  "is in effect,",
  "as shown, the active unit's",
  "symbol is marked",
  "with a triangle,",
  "and this spot also shows",
  "the icon of the active",
  "skill, and its effect",
  "is reflected in the strength value.",
  "When a character's skill",
  "takes effect,",
  "the skill's name appears",
  "brightly on the upper screen,",
  "and its effect is reflected",
  "in the strength value.",
  "If conditions aren't met",
  "and the skill doesn't activate,",
  "its name stays dark.",
  "Incidentally, a skill",
  "shown with a red line",
  "means that \"Skill Break,\"",
  "a skill some characters",
  "and units possess,",
  "has taken effect",
  "on it.",
  "Here too, Amuro",
  "possesses a skill with",
  "the \"Skill Break\" effect,",
  "and it has activated.",
  "Lastly,",
  "another effect that applies",
  "is the terrain effect.",
  "Terrain effect means that,",
  "for the terrain where",
  "the battle is fought, its",
  "[Attack Modifier] parameter",
  "affects the attacking team,",
  "and its [Defense Modifier]",
  "affects the defending team.",
  "That is",
  "this value here.",
  "With all of the above",
  "effects applied,",
  "the final strength value",
  "is this number.",
  "The base for strength values",
  "is [Attack Power] for attackers",
  "and [Defense Power] for",
  "defenders.",
  "And the outcome of a battle",
  "is decided by the ratio",
  "of these strength values.",
  "Based on that ratio,",
  "how each team's unit count",
  "will change from its losses",
  "is shown here, on",
  "the upper screen.",
  "This part",
  "is the same as",
  "what I explained before.",
  "Shown below the unit count change",
  "are [Advance]",
  "and [Retreat]; let me",
  "explain them briefly too.",
  "With [Advance], once the battle",
  "ends, the team is able",
  "to move",
  "one more area.",
  "You can freely choose",
  "where to go, but you can also",
  "choose not to move",
  "and stay where you are.",
  "In battle, when your strength",
  "far exceeds the enemy's,",
  "it occurs more easily;",
  "the number beside it is the odds.",
  "[Retreat] likewise means that",
  "after the battle, the team",
  "is able to move",
  "one more area.",
  "The difference from [Advance]",
  "is that the places you can move to",
  "are limited to enemy-free areas,",
  "and that you also cannot cancel",
  "and remain",
  "where you are.",
  "That sums up the difference.",
  "Moreover,",
  "if, for example, you are",
  "surrounded by enemies on all sides",
  "and have nowhere to [Retreat],",
  "the team is forcibly",
  "treated as destroyed",
  "and withdrawn",
  "from the battlefield.",
  "falls far short of the enemy's,",
  "[Advance] and [Retreat] alike",
  "are sometimes 100% ruled out;",
  "in that case, nothing",
  "is shown here.",
  "Also, when neither [Advance]",
  "nor [Retreat] occurs,",
  "and neither team",
  "is wiped out,",
  "so that units from",
  "both teams remain, they enter",
  "the 'Continued Battle'",
  "state.",
  "This state",
  "carries over as it is,",
  "and on the next turn",
  "the battle resumes.",
  "Note that a team in the",
  "'Continued Battle' state must",
  "always fight,",
  "and cannot move.",
  "Now, I've strayed a little",
  "from the main topic,",
  "so let me return to it.",
  "Once the forecast of the outcome",
  "is fully laid out,",
  "you can choose to go ahead",
  "with the battle or call it off.",
  "Selecting 'Start'",
  "launches the battle,",
  "while 'Back' calls it off.",
  "is undone, and you return",
  "to the previous state.",
  "Here, let's go back",
  "for the moment.",
  "Whether to attack again",
  "or lie in wait for the enemy",
  "is a decision I'll",
  "leave to you.",
  "That was long, but",
  "it concludes my explanation",
  "of combat.",
  "For now, anyway,",
  "focus on the enemy before you",
  "and aim",
  "for victory in battle."
 ]
}
